    "body": "<h2 id=\"h_01HTMMQ0MFBNBPFCBKJT7B7YPF\">You will learn</h2>\n<p>Learn about useful Klaviyo integrations and apps for your ecommerce business. Klaviyo is a powerful platform where you can communicate with your customers and make data-driven marketing choices for your company. Understanding all that is capable in Klaviyo is an important first step. The more software you integrate with Klaviyo, the more data will be in your account that you can use to further target your business' marketing goals.</p>\n<p>It's likely that you use a number of different services to manage your business. Luckily, Klaviyo integrates with many platforms, which allows you to have your data all in one place. This article will help you figure out what your business needs and which integrations you can sync with Klaviyo.</p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HTMMQ0MFBFH24D8WMTYD2P5C\">Ecommerce platform integrations</h2>\n<p>If you’re selling products, ecommerce store platforms are where you can host, sell, and make transactions. These platforms make it easy to display all of your products and manage your sales without needing coding resources upfront. Here are a few that are commonly used and integrate with Klaviyo:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005080407\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Shopify</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005255808\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">WooCommerce</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005082547\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BigCommerce</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/11117215837211\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Square Online</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/6202669053723\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Wix</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005254348\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Magento 2</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/360054551492\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">PrestaShop</a> </strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/360033744951\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Salesforce Commerce Cloud</a></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Are you also using Amazon Buy with Prime alongside your ecommerce integration? Check out <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/14708088221467\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Klaviyo's Buy with Prime integration</a>. </p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HTMMQ0MF6YP4HR4WP34YBN2H\">Landing page integrations</h2>\n<p>Landing pages are useful if you want to direct traffic from social media, email, or an ad to a particular page.</p>\n<p>You can use landing pages to generate insight about your customers, increase conversions, and increase brand awareness. Klaviyo integrates with the following landing page apps. </p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong><a href=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/115000691992\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Kickoff Labs</a> and <a href=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005082507\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Unbounce</a><br></strong>One-stop-shop for landing pages</li>\n<li>\n<strong><a href=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/115000107112\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Typeform</a> and <a href=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005254868\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Wufoo</a><br></strong>Great for survey taking</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HTMMQ0MF8WZ67VPBT3JDZ570\">Advertising integrations</h2>\n<p>Drive your advertising strategy with Klaviyo: re-target existing customers, target similar audiences, and more. </p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005082127\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Facebook Advertising / Meta</strong></a><br>Sync custom audiences to Facebook and sync lead ad subscribers to Klaviyo</li>\n<li>\n<strong><a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/6353315757211\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google Ads</a><br></strong>Sync lists, segments, and profiles from Klaviyo to Google</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HTMMQ0MF94737FBKG3CSZETB\">Payment software integrations</h2>\n<p>If your ecommerce store platform does not offer the capability to make transactions with your customers, you can use a payment software service to make processing order payments simple. Klaviyo integrates with:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005082247\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Chargebee</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005082207\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Recurly</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005082267\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Stripe</a></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>However, it's likely that your ecommerce platform has the native ability to process payment transactions.</p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HTMMQ0MFDCR8K7T2FNKQC28A\">Shipping integrations</h2>\n<p>Integrate with a shipping platform in order to target and personalize messaging based on shipping statuses and information. </p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005080927\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">AfterShip</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/360028298592\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ShipStation</a></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HTMMQ0MFK5PNSFT4VH2Z2009\">Help Desk and Support integrations</h2>\n<p>Integrate with a Help Desk or Support platform to exclude those with open tickets from messaging and more. </p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/4408023789083\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Gorgias</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005081607\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Help Scout</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005081447\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Olark</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005253728\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Zendesk</a></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HTMMQ0MFV42HAPEM5N733WVE\">Other integrations</h2>\n<p>Klaviyo has many other integrations and apps to make your businesses successful. If you find yourself in need of another integration for your business, <a href=\"https://marketplace.klaviyo.com/en-us/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">check out our app marketplace</a> to see all the apps that are available to use with Klaviyo (both those built by Klaviyo, and those built by third parties). </p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HTMMQ0MF8H3QGF23N7B7NMJ0\">Additional resources</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/360049626051\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Understanding third party integrations</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/categories/115000032731\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Integrations section on the Klaviyo Help Center</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p> </p>",
